# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip From Duskwood take the road south; the camp sits in the hills west of the road.
  accept 207 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 574 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sergeant Yohwa

step Kurzen's Compound
  tip Wendel Mathers, a cook, is caged at the compound's western edge: take his quest now and keep it, his cage key and the fighter's uniform come on the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide, when the Subchiefs and Elites are your level. Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave, and Herod's strongbox sits by the cave mouth. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.
  tip Careful: Kurzen Commandos are level 34-35, not elite, and often spawn stealthed; near death they use Smoke Bomb. Colonel Kurzen, an elite of 39-40, stands at the compound's north end: leave him be.
  accept 97047 @44.3,7.9 map 1434     -- Wendel Mathers, in his cage
  kill 938 quest 574.1 @46.3,7.8 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Kurzen Commando
  kill 941 quest 574.2 @46.4,7.9 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Kurzen Headshrinker, below ground

step Kurzen's Compound
  when onquest 328
  turnin 328 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Bookie Herod's Strongbox, below ground

step Kurzen's Compound
  accept 329 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Bloodscalp Ear on the way
  along until q189
  when onquest 189
  collect 1519 quest 189 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Lake Nazferiti
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip South from the compound to Lake Nazferiti: the Venture Co. Geologists in the camps on its shore carry the Tumbled Crystals. Careful: Venture Co. Agents (39) walk among them: take the Geologists on the camps' edges, one at a time. Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) prowl stealthed in the jungle south and east of the lake: keep to the shore camps.
  collect 4106 quest 213 @44.5,20.5 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Tumbled Crystal

step The jungle ruins
  tip West across the jungle to the troll ruins: each holds one stone tablet of the troll legends, the first two in the ruins south-west of Nesingwary's camp, the last two on the hill in the north-west.
  collect 2005 quest 207.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The First Troll Legend: Moon Over the Vale
  collect 2006 quest 207.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Second Troll Legend: Gri'lek the Wanderer; underwater

step Water Elementals
  tip The haunted island lies just off the shore west of the second tablet: the Lesser Water Elementals rise from the water around it.
  collect 3923 quest 601 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Water Elemental Bracers

step The Ruins of Zul'Kunda
  label q189
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Careful: the Bloodscalp Berserkers, Headhunters and Witch Doctors (36-37) hold the ruins' core: pull them one at a time.
  collect 2007 quest 207.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Third Troll Legend: Fall of Gurubashi
  accept 97329                        -- Zimmix Sputterspark, in his cage beside the third tablet
  collect 1519 quest 189 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Bloodscalp Ear
  collect 277957 quest 97329          -- Primitive Key, from the Bloodscalp trolls
  turnin 97329
  accept 97331                        -- For Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay, at the end of this loop
  complete 97331 @26.8,11.4
  collect 2008 quest 207.4 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Fourth Troll Legend: The Emperor's Tomb
  collect 277953 quest 97328 @24.8,13.0 map 1434 -- Stolen Shipment

step The Lashtail raptors
  tip East from the ruins to the hilltop south-west of Nesingwary's camp: the Lashtail Raptors run in the jungle around it. Leave Sin'Dall, the great tiger (37) on the hilltop, to the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide: you're about 35 here. Then on to the hunters' tents.
  kill 686 quest 195 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Lashtail Raptor

